{
  "style": "Premium stadium-night cartoon-realism: chunky, semi-stylised cricketer avatars and objects rendered with soft cel-shaded volumes plus glossy painterly highlights, in the vein of EA FC Mobile card polish and Clash Royale toy-like materials. Thick deep-navy outer outlines (3-4px at 1080 wide) with thinner inner colour-keyed lines, rounded corners everywhere, and bevelled, embossed surfaces. Lighting is a warm golden-hour key from top-left with cool teal-blue rim light from stadium floodlights behind; floodlight bokeh, lens-flare streaks and a faint haze give depth. Materials: lacquered red cricket-ball leather with stitched cream seams, polished gold trims with specular streaks, brushed navy enamel card faces, frosted glass HUD plates, striped mown-grass velvet for the table. Foil holographic sheen sweeps across rare cards. Shading is three-tone with a soft ambient-occlusion gradient and drop shadows that lift cards off the pitch. Mood: electric, celebratory, competitive yet friendly (Everyone-rated, no violence); saturated but disciplined colour, one hero focal point per screen, generous negative space, high-contrast legible numerals, colour-blind-safe icon shapes paired with every colour cue.",
